# Serve this site's files exactly as committed.
#
# Without this file GitHub Pages runs everything through Jekyll, which skips
# paths beginning with "_" or "." and adds a build step this site has no use for
# - it is a manifest, some firmware binaries and one static page.
#
# GitHub only checks that this file EXISTS; the contents are ignored. The text
# is here so it does not look like stray cruft and get tidied away.
